WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.007
[theme music playing]

01:03.229 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:06.983 --> 01:08.276
My name is Hunbish.

01:08.985 --> 01:09.861
[scoffs softly]

01:11.362 --> 01:12.655
[Sade growling softly]

01:12.739 --> 01:14.657
What happened last night?

01:31.883 --> 01:34.886
[woman] Shadi came,
and he took us out of the ring.

01:37.597 --> 01:39.390
[grunts, panting]

01:41.434 --> 01:42.268
Run away.

01:48.525 --> 01:52.070
[woman] The entire world
had fallen into a deep sleep.

01:53.488 --> 01:55.907
Shadi pulled a string off of Father's rug,

01:55.990 --> 01:58.243
and he took it with him
as he left the house.

01:59.202 --> 02:00.203
He said

02:01.246 --> 02:02.789
to run away, so I did.

02:09.838 --> 02:11.047
What was the string for?

02:13.133 --> 02:14.717
Why did you put everyone to sleep?

02:17.595 --> 02:18.513
Tisah.

02:25.770 --> 02:27.355
-[gags]
-[gasps]

02:30.358 --> 02:32.652
[gagging]

02:35.196 --> 02:36.447
[Jun-u gasping]

02:38.408 --> 02:40.451
[Jun-u retching]

02:42.495 --> 02:44.164
What did you find out yesterday?

02:45.206 --> 02:46.875
A way to cut off those shackles?

02:47.458 --> 02:49.711
Or someone to do it for you?

02:51.629 --> 02:53.590
When Iblis wakes up, be aware,

02:53.673 --> 02:55.341
he will know that I was here.

02:55.425 --> 02:57.218
-[tense music plays]
-[apple thuds]

02:57.302 --> 03:01.014
Ah! You have this silly hope
that your brother will show,

03:01.097 --> 03:02.891
and that he will free you. Is that right?

03:03.892 --> 03:06.978
Do you know why
I didn't bind your feet together?

03:07.687 --> 03:09.397
Or fuse your stupid mouth shut,

03:09.480 --> 03:12.775
even though I knew you could
make the world sleep at will?

03:16.613 --> 03:17.906
I was curious to see

03:18.865 --> 03:21.326
if she could break
my thread off this time or not.

03:23.119 --> 03:26.706
I was also anxious to see
if you would reveal your true intent.

03:31.628 --> 03:33.129
Now my questions' been answered.

03:33.212 --> 03:35.048
You still want to do this, Khalid?

03:36.049 --> 03:38.843
You must be careful.
My brother could kill you for this.

03:38.927 --> 03:42.347
How would he do that?
Once I get my hands on that lamp,

03:43.681 --> 03:46.059
and I become the master
controlling the wishes,

03:46.893 --> 03:49.520
then I'll be the only one
who can remove my threads.

03:50.605 --> 03:53.483
And I would become the leader
of all the spirits in the world!

03:54.192 --> 03:56.527
[tense music intensifies]

03:59.322 --> 04:00.281
[music fades]

04:00.365 --> 04:01.950
-Who's Khalid?
-What in the--

04:03.076 --> 04:06.204
-What are you still doing here?
-What am I still doing here?

04:06.287 --> 04:09.666
All of you left me here!
How could I get out?

04:10.250 --> 04:11.292
Oh, right.

04:11.376 --> 04:13.711
Wait, isn't that thing kind of heavy?

04:16.547 --> 04:18.007
So tell me about Khalid.

04:19.217 --> 04:20.051
Khalid?

04:20.677 --> 04:23.179
-Not sure who he is.
-You don't know who he is, how would I?

04:23.263 --> 04:26.349
You're the one detained me here.
We're in this mess because of you.

04:26.432 --> 04:28.851
You're kidding. I saw what went down.

04:28.935 --> 04:31.896
You would've gotten detained
even if it weren't for me, you Satan!

04:31.980 --> 04:36.484
That God of yours was using me to test out
how resilient his creations are!

04:38.069 --> 04:40.446
You're… right. [chuckles]

04:41.739 --> 04:43.324
At least you owned up to that.

04:46.661 --> 04:49.580
[sighs] I touched it
because it was flowing.

04:50.957 --> 04:54.377
-And then I saw something in it.
-Hmm? What did you see?

04:58.506 --> 05:00.883
[Ka-young] It seemed like a distant past.

05:00.967 --> 05:03.720
A boy was weaving a rug.
It was still light out.

05:05.513 --> 05:06.556
I was there next to him.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.850
Then I called out his name.

05:08.933 --> 05:10.268
Khalid.

05:11.769 --> 05:12.645
[chuckles softly]

05:14.230 --> 05:16.607
-It was you?
-I know it was.

05:16.691 --> 05:19.277
-I was as beautiful as I am now.
-[chuckles softly]

05:23.031 --> 05:24.824
And now, get me the hell out of here.

05:25.867 --> 05:27.452
Oh, dear! [sighs]

05:28.077 --> 05:30.038
Come on, you're getting it everywhere.

05:37.128 --> 05:40.131
Grandma, shake your arm.
Is it heavy?

05:41.758 --> 05:45.219
I don't get it. What is it?
Part of a new trend?

05:45.303 --> 05:46.971
Oh Pan-geum, try to break it.

05:47.597 --> 05:48.765
You want me to break it?

05:48.848 --> 05:50.892
-Okay. [grunts]
-Huh?

05:50.975 --> 05:52.143
That was easy.

05:52.226 --> 05:54.353
No effect on humans, apparently.

05:56.522 --> 05:59.067
-Try it on my wrist.
-[sighs] Be careful.

05:59.901 --> 06:04.781
As a spirit, I have… [straining]
infinite magic powers.

06:05.448 --> 06:07.116
[grunting]

06:09.827 --> 06:11.245
[exhales]

06:11.329 --> 06:12.413
See? Huh?

06:12.497 --> 06:13.623
Clearly, you don't.

06:15.666 --> 06:17.627
No effect from a spirit to a mortal.

06:19.462 --> 06:21.130
-Try tying yourself.
-What?

06:22.715 --> 06:24.383
Uh… [chuckles nervously]

06:25.218 --> 06:27.929
The thing is,
we shouldn't take any chances.

06:28.012 --> 06:29.680
-I don't wanna end up like before.
-Do it.

06:29.764 --> 06:30.598
I'll do it.

06:31.390 --> 06:32.934
[grunts, groans]

06:34.393 --> 06:35.853
[vibrating]

06:35.937 --> 06:37.146
[strains]

06:37.230 --> 06:38.231
-[grunts]
-Oh.

06:38.856 --> 06:40.775
[Iblis] I did it. Now break it.

06:41.567 --> 06:42.610
You're gonna do it, right?

06:43.694 --> 06:45.154
Grandma, you try to break it.

06:45.780 --> 06:49.075
Okay. Is this some kind of game
the kids are playing now?

06:50.201 --> 06:51.035
All right.

06:55.248 --> 06:58.209
[grunts] Oh, whoa. It was easy before.

06:59.710 --> 07:02.088
-[sighs] Let me grab something.
-[Iblis] You can't?

07:02.171 --> 07:03.673
[Mi-ju] Let's see here.

07:04.340 --> 07:05.591
Mm, let's see.

07:06.175 --> 07:07.135
Great.

07:07.718 --> 07:09.387
[Mi-ju sighs, grunts]

07:10.596 --> 07:11.848
[Mi-ju] I can't even cut it.

07:13.808 --> 07:14.767
Wait here.

07:15.518 --> 07:17.061
I got stronger ones in the shed.

07:17.145 --> 07:18.646
Hey, you tried for two seconds.

07:19.439 --> 07:20.481
[strains] Hey!

07:20.565 --> 07:23.401
It's only effective
when a spirit ties up another spirit.

07:23.484 --> 07:26.112
-That's the rule of the string.
-Okay, understood.

07:26.195 --> 07:28.030
Break this off, okay? [chuckles nervously]

07:28.531 --> 07:30.950
By the way… [retches]
the string smells like blood.

07:31.534 --> 07:33.536
-Huh?
-Blood?

07:41.502 --> 07:45.089
It was originally white.
But now it's black from the blood.

07:45.173 --> 07:48.468
Given what we learned about the string
and who can break it,

07:48.551 --> 07:50.094
the blood is probably mine.

07:50.178 --> 07:51.929
[gasps] Really?

07:52.513 --> 07:55.433
Okay, break it. Let's get it off
and take a closer look at it.

07:56.767 --> 08:01.647
[sighs] About that floating urn,
the grains are so fine.

08:01.731 --> 08:04.150
I was out there a long time
before you buried me.

08:04.650 --> 08:07.361
-Grandma! You find the garden shears yet?
-[Iblis] Hold on.

08:07.445 --> 08:09.655
-Wait. [grunts]
-[Ka-young] We have a bunch in the shed!

08:09.739 --> 08:12.241
Hey, wait. Master! [groans]

08:12.325 --> 08:14.577
-[vibrating]
-Wait, could you just--

08:17.205 --> 08:18.581
Stop stuffing your face, idiot.

08:19.582 --> 08:20.791
[gulps, sighs]

08:22.335 --> 08:24.712
[retching]

08:29.258 --> 08:31.135
-[door closes]
-[pants]

08:33.387 --> 08:34.847
How long are you gonna stay here?

08:37.141 --> 08:38.100
What are you?

08:38.684 --> 08:41.354
You and everyone in this house.
What's happening here?

08:42.063 --> 08:44.065
And why do you call Hunbish your father?

08:44.148 --> 08:47.193
We made a deal to pay off
all of your gambling debts.

08:47.276 --> 08:48.736
You said that's all you wanted.

08:49.654 --> 08:51.614
Why are you asking questions now?

08:52.198 --> 08:54.867
You didn't tell me
I'd be putting lives at stake!

08:58.079 --> 08:59.497
I can't make more mistakes.

09:00.957 --> 09:02.291
After all, I'm his father.

09:10.550 --> 09:13.219
Why the hell are you all so helpless
against that kid?

09:13.803 --> 09:14.762
[laughs derisively]

09:16.347 --> 09:17.640
Oh, how original.

09:18.975 --> 09:21.644
All of Father's previous parents
asked the same thing.

09:22.436 --> 09:26.357
You don't know how it is, growing up
as an orphan with no one.

09:26.941 --> 09:29.110
[child crying, screaming]

09:42.164 --> 09:44.709
When you've experienced
hell on earth,

09:46.460 --> 09:48.421
everything else becomes meaningless.

09:48.504 --> 09:52.049
[child screaming]

09:58.431 --> 10:00.725
[screaming]

10:02.435 --> 10:05.146
The weak get torn apart
by the strong to eat.

10:06.397 --> 10:08.608
It's… basic.

10:08.691 --> 10:10.818
[dark music playing]

10:18.117 --> 10:19.118
[echoing scream]

10:21.120 --> 10:22.747
[gagging]

10:23.664 --> 10:25.625
-[retching]
-Don't do anything stupid.

10:25.708 --> 10:28.252
We'll listen to Father
no matter what you try.

10:28.919 --> 10:30.463
This horseshit stops today.

10:30.546 --> 10:32.923
Because tomorrow,
you're getting hiking gear.

10:35.051 --> 10:38.179
[door opens, closes]

10:38.262 --> 10:40.389
[breath trembling]

10:40.473 --> 10:42.475
[pop music playing over speakers]

10:44.560 --> 10:45.394
[sighs]

10:46.187 --> 10:47.021
Oh.

10:48.439 --> 10:50.524
[sighs] Why do I keep getting stuck here?

10:51.567 --> 10:52.818
[sighs, winces]

10:52.902 --> 10:56.197
It takes so much effort
to be young. [sighs]

10:56.280 --> 10:57.698
-You getting an extra shot?
-[gasps]

10:57.782 --> 11:01.410
I won't ask anything else.
Only about your coffee, all right?

11:03.329 --> 11:04.914
Uh, just a shot.

11:04.997 --> 11:07.667
You want whipped cream?
And caramel syrup too?

11:08.668 --> 11:10.753
[sighs] I keep asking more questions.

11:11.545 --> 11:14.090
Let's just add everything.
It'll be delicious.

11:15.549 --> 11:16.592
[giggles]

11:21.138 --> 11:22.932
I wasn't trying to be funny.

11:24.475 --> 11:26.685
This isn't a question,
don't feel like you've to answer.

11:26.769 --> 11:28.145
I'm just jumping to conclusions.

11:29.105 --> 11:30.106
-Oh.
-[plastic rustles]

11:30.189 --> 11:31.816
You said your name's Lee Mi-ju, right?

11:33.192 --> 11:36.612
That's fake, isn't it? And Lee Beul-li
isn't actually your brother?

11:41.117 --> 11:44.453
[sighs] If you could do me a favor
and answer this one.

11:45.162 --> 11:49.166
Are you running from the law for treason
or some other kind of illicit activity?

11:50.000 --> 11:52.962
Oh, my goodness! It's…
It's not anything like that at all!

11:53.045 --> 11:55.965
[chuckles] Just wanted to check.

11:56.757 --> 11:58.592
And I'm saying this to reassure you.

11:58.676 --> 12:02.012
Ka-young is…
she's the best person I know.

12:02.888 --> 12:04.723
So whatever rumors you hear about her,

12:04.807 --> 12:07.184
there's absolutely no point
in taking them to heart.

12:09.186 --> 12:10.938
[sighs] Oh.

12:13.065 --> 12:15.401
Thank you so much. [crying softly]

12:16.527 --> 12:17.862
Are you crying?

12:17.945 --> 12:18.946
[chuckles softly]

12:20.448 --> 12:21.282
[sniffles]

12:22.867 --> 12:24.994
-[gentle music plays]
-[chuckles]

12:32.626 --> 12:34.086
Are those cherry blossoms?

12:35.087 --> 12:37.965
Huh. I thought the season was over.

12:41.260 --> 12:42.094
[chuckles]

12:44.847 --> 12:46.932
[Yeong-hyeon] All right, everyone,
let's take a look.

12:47.016 --> 12:48.684
-Here--
-[officer] This area's restricted.

12:48.767 --> 12:51.896
[Yeong-hyeon] Didn't you hear that I was
the one to discover it and call it in?

12:52.730 --> 12:53.731
I just want a quick look.

12:53.814 --> 12:56.859
So, everyone, based on the size
of the pelvis that was found,

12:56.942 --> 12:59.111
they're saying the corpse
is likely to be a female.

12:59.195 --> 13:00.905
-[snickering]
-She may have had red hair,

13:00.988 --> 13:02.990
but her hair was dyed
after she was killed.

13:03.073 --> 13:04.658
Let's think this through.

13:04.742 --> 13:08.245
That means that this is
a very, very serious crime.

13:08.329 --> 13:09.872
And guess who discovered it?

13:20.591 --> 13:21.425
Ms. Ki?

13:22.593 --> 13:24.595
What brings you all the way out here?

13:25.846 --> 13:29.183
This was stuck in your taillight.
I saw it when I was fixing your car.

13:29.266 --> 13:32.561
-[suspenseful music plays]
-Well, what are you getting at?

13:33.103 --> 13:36.315
-What… What is this?
-Go on, take a look.

13:37.149 --> 13:40.611
I would say, it looks like a strand
of a woman's bleached blonde hair.

13:47.660 --> 13:51.121
I don't understand. What's going on here?

13:51.747 --> 13:54.750
-Why are you giving this to me?
-Your face says you do understand.

13:55.334 --> 13:58.504
The body they found recently,
you were behind it?

13:59.380 --> 14:02.132
And the person that hair belongs to
is your victim?

14:02.675 --> 14:07.054
Ki Ka-young, if someone overheard us,
they could get the wrong idea.

14:09.223 --> 14:10.057
Just curious…

14:12.601 --> 14:15.187
-did you come here alone?
-Of course not.

14:16.146 --> 14:17.940
You'll never guess
who I'm here with, though.

14:31.161 --> 14:33.247
Don't waste my time and listen carefully.

14:34.331 --> 14:37.042
The police are looking for this woman.
She looks familiar, right?

14:37.126 --> 14:38.836
I mean, just look at that hair.

14:39.879 --> 14:42.381
I actually looked in your truck bed
that day.

14:42.464 --> 14:45.009
Nothing out of the ordinary,
except for one thing.

14:46.510 --> 14:47.720
BLACK HAIR DYE

14:47.803 --> 14:49.305
When the news broke, I understood.

14:49.388 --> 14:52.933
[gasps] Ah, he dyes their hair
after he kills them. That seems fun.

14:53.601 --> 14:55.185
"That seems fun"?

14:56.478 --> 14:58.814
After all, every masterpiece
has a signature.

15:01.108 --> 15:03.193
That's why I'm here. To give you a gift.

15:04.403 --> 15:05.404
Take it.

15:11.869 --> 15:15.080
You're giving this to me
instead of the police?

15:15.789 --> 15:16.957
You want me to have it?

15:18.375 --> 15:19.209
Why?

15:23.339 --> 15:25.549
-[man 1 farts]
-[mourners snickering]

15:26.884 --> 15:29.053
[man 2] Oh, your dinner want
to pay its respects too?

15:30.220 --> 15:31.847
-Well, finish up.
-[mourners laugh]

15:31.931 --> 15:33.724
[man 1 farting]

15:35.309 --> 15:38.103
[man 2] No, no, not that. Finish bowing.

15:38.187 --> 15:40.606
[mourners laughing]

15:41.523 --> 15:44.568
I guess it's the same reason
you came to me to fix your taillight.

15:45.152 --> 15:46.737
You and I are alike, right?

15:46.820 --> 15:48.364
[sinister music plays]

15:48.948 --> 15:50.324
[cackling]

15:52.451 --> 15:55.579
That's what I thought.
You and I are exactly alike!

15:55.663 --> 15:58.207
No. Had it been me,
I wouldn't have left a trace.

15:58.958 --> 16:02.836
If only there was a way to remove
the blemishes from your greatest work.

16:02.920 --> 16:05.422
Oh, but there is a way! Don't worry.

16:06.423 --> 16:09.051
If this all works out,
you wanna do one together?

16:09.134 --> 16:10.678
Fix it and then we'll talk.

16:11.929 --> 16:13.347
Amateurs get in the way.

16:17.017 --> 16:19.144
[suspenseful music plays]

16:23.065 --> 16:23.899
[music fades]

16:29.655 --> 16:32.908
Why did you do that?
Why give the evidence to the culprit?

16:34.201 --> 16:37.079
Right now, he's the only one who knows
where the missing girl is buried.

16:38.288 --> 16:40.708
If I had told the police
and they brought him in,

16:41.583 --> 16:43.919
then that bastard
would just wish his way out.

16:44.003 --> 16:45.629
That woman would never be found.

16:45.713 --> 16:48.674
That's why I gave him a push
to make his last wish sooner.

16:48.757 --> 16:51.844
[sighs] What does that have to do with me?

16:51.927 --> 16:53.345
Why would I deal with this?

16:53.929 --> 16:56.765
Eom Sang-tae will want to find a way
to get rid of any evidence

16:56.849 --> 16:58.100
so no one could track it.

16:58.600 --> 17:02.813
And when he finally makes his last wish,
you'll give my notebook to my past self.

17:02.896 --> 17:04.064
Why should I?

17:04.148 --> 17:06.358
My job is fulfilling wishes.
That's all I need to do.

17:06.442 --> 17:09.403
You're a big liar, you know?
I looked at your lamp some more.

17:09.486 --> 17:12.781
The writing on the bottom says it was made
in a different year than you said.

17:13.282 --> 17:14.408
The Arabic underneath?

17:14.491 --> 17:16.618
It was made in year 1061.

17:16.702 --> 17:19.288
-You haven't seen it?
-Do you check under your floorboards?

17:24.460 --> 17:25.669
OCTOBER 24, 1061

17:25.753 --> 17:26.587
You're right!

17:27.171 --> 17:30.841
Haven't you been complaining
that I got you trapped for 983 years?

17:30.924 --> 17:32.384
But you're off by 20 years.

17:32.468 --> 17:35.262
You could've fooled around for 20 years
and got yourself detained.

17:35.345 --> 17:38.515
That's not it. I counted
every passing year precisely.

17:39.892 --> 17:41.518
So what the hell? How's it off?

17:42.102 --> 17:44.563
-Master. That smell, I found it.
-Oh.

17:45.606 --> 17:46.565
What smell?

17:46.648 --> 17:48.275
I investigate things too, you know.

17:52.321 --> 17:53.447
[sighs]

17:53.530 --> 17:55.532
[ominous music plays]

17:59.078 --> 18:02.039
The smell is slightly different
from the first one we found,

18:02.122 --> 18:05.375
but not entirely different.
Either way, I'm not sure why that is.

18:05.459 --> 18:09.088
However, the scent is coming
from that immortal in that house.

18:13.425 --> 18:16.261
[sniffs] It seems Shadi is here too.

18:20.182 --> 18:22.059
[whirs, stops]

18:22.893 --> 18:24.269
You wanna visit Dubai?

18:24.937 --> 18:25.771
Why?

18:25.854 --> 18:29.233
I have a brother in Dubai who might know
what happened while I was detailed.

18:30.317 --> 18:32.945
We still don't know when Eom Sang-tae
will make his last wish.

18:33.987 --> 18:37.574
Whenever he does, I'll come back.
The notebook's inside the lamp anyway.

18:38.492 --> 18:39.618
I guess you're right.

18:40.619 --> 18:42.121
But why do you want me to go?

18:43.330 --> 18:45.040
You want me to feel safe?

18:45.999 --> 18:48.293
No. I wanna feel safe.

18:49.628 --> 18:51.880
What if I'm tied up again? [laughing]

18:53.757 --> 18:55.884
[whimsical music plays]

18:55.968 --> 18:56.802
[sighs]

19:02.975 --> 19:04.059
I deserve this.

19:06.895 --> 19:09.940
-[Min-ji] What is this group?
-[indistinct announcement over PA]

19:10.524 --> 19:13.026
Oh, I see. He's finally leaving for good?

19:14.194 --> 19:15.028
In your dreams.

19:16.196 --> 19:18.282
I'm pretty sure I only invited you.

19:19.408 --> 19:21.410
She makes me feel safe,
so I want her to come.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.330
I've got things to do when we get there.

19:26.456 --> 19:29.543
Look after Mi-ju for me.
She's never left the country before.

19:29.626 --> 19:31.295
I thought you told me they're siblings.

19:32.129 --> 19:34.214
-But this is her first trip to Dubai?
-[gasps]

19:35.549 --> 19:37.551
-[both] We're new to being siblings.
-Uh-huh.

19:39.011 --> 19:42.306
[scoffs] I don't care anymore.
It's a trip to Dubai.

19:42.806 --> 19:45.642
And we're traveling first-class. Let's go!

19:46.185 --> 19:47.936
[sighs in relief, chuckles]

19:51.481 --> 19:53.692
[nostalgic music plays]

20:11.793 --> 20:13.795
[cheerful music plays]

20:28.101 --> 20:31.605
-[sighs contentedly]
-[gasps] Oh.

20:32.439 --> 20:34.358
[Mi-ju squeals excitedly]

20:35.692 --> 20:38.111
-[exhales]
-[Sade] Thank you.

20:39.655 --> 20:41.823
[Min-ji] I can't take
a bad picture of you.

20:42.449 --> 20:44.076
I didn't see you on the plane.

20:44.159 --> 20:45.702
-Were you sitting by yourself?
-Huh?

20:46.245 --> 20:48.747
-Oh, I took something else. A lam--
-Uh-uh. Shh.

20:50.207 --> 20:52.000
All right, then. Who cares, right?

20:52.793 --> 20:54.419
We got pickup service in a limo.

20:55.003 --> 20:58.340
Let's check into the hotel,
and then we'll find a yummy restaurant.

20:58.423 --> 20:59.800
You all go on ahead.

21:01.343 --> 21:04.263
-We should head to Old Dubai first.
-Why there?

21:17.651 --> 21:18.485
[Iblis] Mm.

21:19.361 --> 21:20.529
You see that jar?

21:20.612 --> 21:22.322
What, you want it?

21:22.406 --> 21:23.573
[smacks lips] No.

21:24.408 --> 21:25.659
I want you to rub it for me.

21:26.702 --> 21:28.412
If I rub it, they won't come out.

21:30.789 --> 21:33.083
[chiming]

21:35.836 --> 21:37.838
[magical music plays]

21:49.182 --> 21:51.226
-[gasps]
-Song Hye-kyo!

21:53.395 --> 21:55.397
-Right?
-You must know this face?

21:56.231 --> 21:57.941
You were rubbing the jar so vigorously,

21:58.025 --> 22:01.570
I picked this face from a K-drama
on Netflix that I just binge-watched.

22:04.740 --> 22:07.117
[sighs] This was a setup.

22:08.243 --> 22:09.995
-Would you get lost?
-[Iblis grunts softly]

22:10.579 --> 22:12.873
So you're a spirit too? A genie?

22:14.958 --> 22:17.169
You made her rub the jar
without telling her?

22:18.045 --> 22:20.047
Me? His ex-girlfriend.

22:21.131 --> 22:23.383
Ah. Jinniya.

22:23.967 --> 22:24.968
Hmm?

22:25.802 --> 22:28.513
It's been a really long time, hasn't it?

22:29.306 --> 22:31.224
Why don't we have a chat?

22:31.308 --> 22:33.810
A chat? You wanna chat,
just the two of us?

22:34.811 --> 22:37.481
That coffee set I gave you,
from 10 BC, I want it.

22:39.733 --> 22:41.276
[gasps, whines]

22:46.114 --> 22:48.992
I have no idea where that is.
It's probably buried somewhere.

22:49.076 --> 22:51.203
How about the rug I got you?
At least give me that.

22:52.621 --> 22:54.664
[Iblis] Really? That old thing?

22:55.457 --> 22:58.293
If it is out there,
it's probably all gross.

22:58.877 --> 23:01.046
All right, enjoy your chat together.

23:02.130 --> 23:03.757
You're dead meat. See you later.

23:04.549 --> 23:05.383
[sighs]

23:06.176 --> 23:08.512
Wait, I know you.
You're that little shit, aren't you?

23:08.595 --> 23:11.556
-Uh--
-You're another freak who knows me too?

23:11.640 --> 23:13.475
We call it reincarnation.

23:14.976 --> 23:15.894
[scoffs]

23:17.104 --> 23:18.688
Well, her comebacks are quick.

23:19.272 --> 23:21.024
[Iblis] So, do you think…

23:21.108 --> 23:23.276
we could go… into your jar?

23:24.152 --> 23:25.112
You think I'm insane?

23:25.654 --> 23:27.697
[sighs] I am insane.

23:28.740 --> 23:30.367
Why did I let you in here again?

23:31.034 --> 23:33.245
I'm impressed
with your decorative restraint.

23:33.328 --> 23:34.830
It's pared down from before.

23:35.831 --> 23:37.249
Time has helped, I see.

23:37.833 --> 23:40.585
Spit it out. What? Why?
Why have you come to see me?

23:41.670 --> 23:43.130
Just let me ask two things.

23:43.213 --> 23:47.467
Number one, did you ever pull a prank
by disguising your face?

23:48.218 --> 23:50.178
Something like today,
with this face you have on.

23:50.262 --> 23:54.099
Would you have used the face
of that woman there who you just met,

23:54.850 --> 23:58.270
who had, you know,
a big, wide, pretty smile?

23:58.353 --> 24:01.356
Get out. And do us all a favor.
Kill yourself.

24:02.065 --> 24:03.900
I guess it wasn't you. Huh.

24:04.776 --> 24:07.654
All right, then, of all our brothers,
do you recall

24:07.737 --> 24:09.406
a brother who controls sleep?

24:10.323 --> 24:11.158
Shadi?

24:11.241 --> 24:12.325
-Yes.
-What about him?

24:13.118 --> 24:15.287
It's been at least six centuries
since I've seen him.

24:15.370 --> 24:18.874
After I fell asleep, he tied a thread
that was really hard to break.

24:18.957 --> 24:20.333
So, you have any info?

24:21.293 --> 24:23.003
Was that the unbreakable thread?

24:23.920 --> 24:28.383
[gasps softly] Now that I recall,
there was a son he had with a human woman.

24:29.092 --> 24:30.385
He used to weave rugs.

24:31.761 --> 24:33.221
He died a while ago.

24:33.305 --> 24:36.516
Half human, half spirit.
He had a human lifespan.

24:36.600 --> 24:40.145
Huh? Shadi, he had a son?

24:41.479 --> 24:42.314
[door opens]

24:44.441 --> 24:46.693
[somber music plays]

24:50.030 --> 24:53.909
We've made it so Shadi's able to talk
only by your command, Father.

24:55.785 --> 24:59.581
At the cherry festival,
I saw Iblis was there.

25:01.750 --> 25:04.461
-[Pan-geum] Buy one or two.
-Sorry, I can't afford that.

25:07.589 --> 25:12.135
[in deep voice] His face was
the same from 963 years ago.

25:12.677 --> 25:16.056
[Shadi] My brother can hide his face,
so you'd never recognize him.

25:16.139 --> 25:20.227
You would be able to recognize him
even when I can't.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.686
You know your brother well.

25:22.479 --> 25:25.357
[in normal voice] If I get rid of Iblis…
[slams cage]

25:25.440 --> 25:27.692
you will bring the lamp here,
will you not?

25:29.110 --> 25:30.028
[sighs]

25:38.954 --> 25:41.248
[Iblis] His son's name, was it Khalid?

25:43.500 --> 25:44.709
I don't know his name.

25:45.794 --> 25:49.172
But in any case, why are you
entangled again with that young woman?

25:49.798 --> 25:52.342
I didn't look for her.
She was reincarnated and found my lamp.

25:52.926 --> 25:53.760
Wait.

25:54.469 --> 25:55.470
Wait a minute.

25:56.805 --> 26:00.600
You recognized Ki Ka-young? She died
at the age of eight in her past life.

26:00.684 --> 26:03.770
What are you saying?
You took a city because of her--

26:05.313 --> 26:06.564
[groans] No way.

26:07.107 --> 26:08.900
Your memories
of those 20 years were sealed.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.945
Forget it. Get lost.

26:12.737 --> 26:14.948
Go. You and I never talked, okay?

26:16.408 --> 26:18.535
Look, wait up. What are you talking about?

26:19.661 --> 26:20.578
[sighs]

26:21.621 --> 26:23.748
So-- So I forgot 20 years?

26:24.416 --> 26:26.001
[laughing]

26:26.084 --> 26:27.002
Huh?

26:28.712 --> 26:29.629
[huffs]

26:30.672 --> 26:32.966
[tense music plays]

26:51.609 --> 26:52.444
[sighs]

26:53.486 --> 26:55.780
[Ejllael] Zahara, that look suits you.

26:55.864 --> 26:58.616
Millions of beautiful flowers suffered
because of you.

26:59.784 --> 27:02.912
You have one flower left,
which is this immortal one.

27:10.045 --> 27:10.962
[scoffs]

27:13.298 --> 27:14.341
Enough of that.

27:15.383 --> 27:17.594
Are you aware that Iblis is out?

27:20.513 --> 27:22.349
He has his freedom so soon?

27:23.641 --> 27:24.601
Where is he, then?

27:26.686 --> 27:28.938
All of you, including Shadi,
get on my nerves.

27:29.022 --> 27:31.524
Each one of you is worse that the next.

27:32.984 --> 27:36.363
Anyway, there's a chance
Iblis will come to you.

27:36.446 --> 27:37.697
Stay vigilant.

27:39.407 --> 27:42.369
And don't tell him about the past.
What was sealed stays sealed.

27:47.415 --> 27:50.835
Your error had consequences. Right?

27:54.214 --> 27:57.550
[tense music intensifies, fades]

27:59.260 --> 28:00.512
Iblis had a meeting?

28:01.262 --> 28:04.391
[Irem] With Jinniya.
They may be meeting right now.

28:05.058 --> 28:06.184
He asked me where she was.

28:06.851 --> 28:08.603
Your insolence knows no bounds.

28:09.354 --> 28:12.440
I'd just restrained Zahara,
now this? Jinniya?

28:14.609 --> 28:15.485
[gasps]

28:17.153 --> 28:18.738
[choking]

28:18.822 --> 28:21.533
What made you think you could do things
without my permission?

28:22.200 --> 28:25.870
Jinniya will let something slip,
and Iblis will surely keep on digging.

28:25.954 --> 28:28.164
He'll shake his brothers down
for any clue!

28:28.248 --> 28:29.707
[mouthing] I… made…

28:31.709 --> 28:32.669
a huge mistake.

28:33.503 --> 28:36.548
I did block your ears, but now you fly
around here, there, and everywhere.

28:37.173 --> 28:39.509
I'll take away your speech
for saying things freely.

28:39.592 --> 28:41.177
[Irem choking]

28:41.261 --> 28:42.595
You'll be careful now

28:43.888 --> 28:45.515
if you want to keep your other senses.

28:46.057 --> 28:49.060
-[tense music playing]
-[soft whirring]

29:03.283 --> 29:05.285
[tense music intensifies]

29:11.499 --> 29:12.333
[music stops]

29:15.462 --> 29:17.088
What the hell are you doing here?

29:17.797 --> 29:21.801
Iblis told me to follow and protect you…
from anything bad happening.

29:21.885 --> 29:24.095
In case I die, he wants me to be with you?

29:24.179 --> 29:27.223
He's waiting for the right time
to kill you. He's waited a thousand years.

29:28.725 --> 29:30.810
He had a thousand-year love with Jinniya.

29:32.228 --> 29:33.438
Why did that love end?

29:33.521 --> 29:35.440
Ah, you figured that out?

29:35.523 --> 29:36.483
Irem ended our fling.

29:37.108 --> 29:40.570
Whoa, TMI.
I was referring to Jinniya with Iblis.

29:40.653 --> 29:43.490
Oh, my master and Jinniya. Those two.

29:44.157 --> 29:46.910
My poor master was rejected by Jinniya.

29:46.993 --> 29:48.578
-Why?
-She's so beautiful.

29:49.162 --> 29:52.457
Master is barely in her league. Frankly,
I'm not surprised she ditched him.

29:53.124 --> 29:54.083
[Sade chuckles]

29:55.210 --> 29:58.713
You know that wiper fluid you drank?
I'm taking that out of your check.

29:59.964 --> 30:00.799
That's rough.

30:01.341 --> 30:03.343
[gentle music plays]

30:10.642 --> 30:12.393
[both chuckle]

30:14.312 --> 30:15.313
[sighs contentedly]

30:18.817 --> 30:20.777
[Mi-ju] Oh, my goodness.
How much gold is this?

30:22.946 --> 30:24.113
Over there. There, look.

30:28.034 --> 30:30.119
[Min-ji] Sounds like
you don't know her illness.

30:30.203 --> 30:31.704
It's not a curable condition.

30:33.873 --> 30:37.794
I see her take pills though,
and set alarms for them too.

30:37.877 --> 30:40.547
[Min-ji] She takes one for sleep,
another to suppress her cravings,

30:40.630 --> 30:42.465
but the rest might as well be candy.

30:42.549 --> 30:44.801
They're more
for her grandma's peace of mind.

30:44.884 --> 30:47.387
-Don't mention that to her grandma.
-[gasps softly]

30:49.389 --> 30:52.308
She's kept secrets. So many secrets.

30:52.892 --> 30:56.145
Hey, you. That face, I know it.
No, don't worry.

30:57.605 --> 31:00.608
She may not have emotions,
but she's amazing, truly.

31:00.692 --> 31:02.569
The medication is helping her a lot.

31:03.403 --> 31:05.864
That right? Yeah, of course it is.

31:06.489 --> 31:08.575
If I don't believe you,
who would I believe?

31:08.658 --> 31:10.368
You're Ka-young's closest friend.

31:11.411 --> 31:15.206
Right. Now stop worrying about other women
and start thinking about me.

31:16.374 --> 31:19.544
I've never gotten heels
because I'm so tall.

31:20.879 --> 31:22.213
Should I get these or not?

31:22.797 --> 31:26.259
[gasps] If the shoe fits,
then it's found its rightful owner.

31:27.093 --> 31:28.928
Get them. I'll buy them for you.

31:29.012 --> 31:30.847
Yeah? Excuse me!

31:30.930 --> 31:32.390
-Oh. Oh, oh.
-I'd like to buy these.

31:32.473 --> 31:34.475
-Hey--
-Oh, you're out of your mind.

31:34.559 --> 31:35.935
You know how much these are?

31:36.019 --> 31:38.313
-You're supposed to talk me out of it.
-No. Don't!

31:38.396 --> 31:40.481
Wear those out. I have money.

31:41.232 --> 31:43.693
I made so much from stocks. Mm?

31:45.028 --> 31:46.613
I just wanna buy you something, okay?

31:48.948 --> 31:49.824
Mm?

31:53.703 --> 31:57.582
[tour guide] The blade in the rock
is called Muttalib's sword or Iblis' rage.

31:57.665 --> 32:00.835
According to legend, Muttalib,
the outsider, stole Iblis' treasure,

32:00.919 --> 32:04.964
and the enraged Iblis struck this sword
into this rock as an act of warning.

32:05.048 --> 32:06.341
It has stayed here ever since.

32:06.424 --> 32:09.469
No one can remove the sword
no matter how hard they try.

32:09.552 --> 32:11.471
As the city developed,
they made a square here

32:11.554 --> 32:13.097
and built buildings around it.

32:17.143 --> 32:19.354
[slow surreal music plays]

32:31.074 --> 32:33.242
Satan's shown his face here!

32:34.577 --> 32:36.746
-[gasps softly]
-So, you're sightseeing?

32:36.829 --> 32:38.539
Oh. Not at all.

32:41.834 --> 32:44.420
I heard you went to the desert,
so I was out for a walk.

32:47.256 --> 32:49.759
-So that's your rage over there?
-Pardon?

32:52.553 --> 32:53.388
Hmm?

32:59.769 --> 33:01.896
What? How's that there?

33:04.357 --> 33:06.985
-[mysterious music plays]
-[energy whooshing]

33:14.993 --> 33:16.786
Is this sword really your deep rage?

33:16.869 --> 33:19.122
I don't know if I'd call it rage.

33:21.082 --> 33:24.002
This is my sword,
but why is it stuck in this rock?

33:26.129 --> 33:28.381
-Uh--
-Huh, it really is mine.

33:28.923 --> 33:30.383
Guess I got drunk one night…

33:31.759 --> 33:33.428
and left it here. [chuckles]

33:34.137 --> 33:35.179
I did do that regularly.

33:35.930 --> 33:37.557
-Stick the sword in the rock again.
-Hmm?

33:37.640 --> 33:39.142
This is a tourist attraction.

33:39.225 --> 33:41.310
That's a rule here.
You have to follow the rules.

33:41.394 --> 33:42.520
I'm putting it back, okay?

33:43.438 --> 33:45.648
I only carried it with me
to show off anyway.

33:46.941 --> 33:49.986
Seeing them enjoy it
makes me really proud.

33:51.696 --> 33:54.490
I'll just leave it until I figure out
the reason why it's here.

33:59.537 --> 34:01.080
-[claps]
-[energy whooshes]

34:03.416 --> 34:06.794
-[strains] I think I made it move.
-[tour guide] Of course. Who's next?

34:06.878 --> 34:09.338
You've no money,
so what precious things do you own?

34:09.422 --> 34:11.507
Ah, the coffee set your ex got you?

34:11.591 --> 34:13.718
-Ah, the rug that your ex got you?
-Oh, by the way,

34:13.801 --> 34:15.803
who was that woman at the airport?

34:15.887 --> 34:18.473
[groans] It's been bothering me.

34:18.556 --> 34:20.808
I know her. Min-ji's ex-girlfriend.

34:20.892 --> 34:22.769
You and her both have ex-girlfriends.

34:22.852 --> 34:24.604
Ah. [laughs]

34:25.271 --> 34:27.273
That's why she was looking forlorn.

34:27.356 --> 34:30.902
Do exes always evoke that emotion?
Is that how you feel about yours?

34:30.985 --> 34:32.862
Why do we always talk in circles?

34:35.031 --> 34:37.450
Why was Min-ji's ex-girlfriend
glaring at you?

34:38.367 --> 34:40.453
I don't know. She's always been that way.

34:43.581 --> 34:46.709
Gamja-tang again? Really?
Do you know what day it is today?

34:47.251 --> 34:49.045
I do. Of course, my love, yeah.

34:49.670 --> 34:53.299
It's our 300-day anniversary.
We had already set the date.

34:53.382 --> 34:55.343
[woman slams cutlery]
I'm not hungry anymore.

34:55.426 --> 34:57.553
There are other places
we could've gone to.

34:57.637 --> 34:59.222
Why gamja-tang?

34:59.305 --> 35:01.891
You can munch on the marrow and the bones.
Very satisfying.

35:01.974 --> 35:04.310
Would you stop already,
so we can talk without you?

35:04.393 --> 35:05.853
[sucks, slurps]

35:05.937 --> 35:09.482
[sighs] Choi Min-ji, it's me
or your best friend. Choose.

35:11.359 --> 35:12.360
Just go.

35:14.028 --> 35:14.904
I loved you.

35:16.447 --> 35:17.281
[scoffs]

35:18.866 --> 35:21.619
All right, fine.
Goodbye, have a nice life.

35:26.707 --> 35:28.793
What's wrong?
She said, "Have a nice life."

35:29.669 --> 35:31.546
You can still see me and keep seeing her.

35:32.171 --> 35:33.005
[sighs]

35:33.965 --> 35:35.633
That's not how it works.

35:38.886 --> 35:40.763
[cries softly]

35:40.847 --> 35:43.141
[Sade] I'm experiencing
unrequited love too.

35:43.850 --> 35:45.059
It's heartbreaking.

35:45.726 --> 35:47.103
My sweet love has a coat,

35:48.062 --> 35:49.605
it's fluffy and very cute--

35:49.689 --> 35:51.023
We didn't ask you.

35:52.733 --> 35:55.236
What should we do today?
Today is our last day.

35:55.862 --> 35:58.906
Ka-young said we'll go,
just the two of us, somewhere.

35:58.990 --> 36:01.325
Oh, just you two? Why? Where?

36:02.785 --> 36:03.744
[grunts dismissively]

36:04.328 --> 36:06.789
[gasps in pain] Ah, goodness.

36:09.292 --> 36:10.668
Hey, Ka-young, come.

36:11.419 --> 36:13.546
Hurry. Will you put this on me?

36:14.922 --> 36:15.882
Here.

36:15.965 --> 36:17.550
All right, over here.

36:17.633 --> 36:20.219
Will you stop relying on pain patches
and get checked out?

36:21.012 --> 36:25.725
This is all I need. The hospital will want
to perform surgery, and who has the time?

36:25.808 --> 36:27.935
I can't have a knife cutting into my body.

36:28.019 --> 36:30.271
The Miss Korea competition's still on.

36:30.813 --> 36:32.815
I could still have a chance
to compete in it.

36:33.441 --> 36:37.195
My mom was angry when I married.
She threw a huge fit.

36:37.987 --> 36:41.490
"Don't get married,
go to a salon instead." She was furious.

36:41.574 --> 36:42.950
Should I be laughing?

36:43.034 --> 36:44.410
-[Pan-geum laughs]
-[dryly] Ha-ha.

36:46.954 --> 36:48.122
[sighs] All right.

36:48.206 --> 36:50.416
So, Grandma, do you… do you miss Mother?

36:51.042 --> 36:51.876
Mine?

36:53.169 --> 36:55.338
Yeah, I miss her. Of course I do.

36:57.256 --> 37:00.343
I got married, then she was gone
less than a year after.

37:00.426 --> 37:02.386
No, not your mom, my mom.

37:05.848 --> 37:06.849
Your daughter.

37:08.893 --> 37:09.894
Oh.

37:10.645 --> 37:12.897
Uh, well, I don't know.

37:14.899 --> 37:16.234
I think of her, of course,

37:16.943 --> 37:21.113
even though she hasn't even visited
in 20 years, so…

37:23.532 --> 37:24.659
That brat.

37:26.035 --> 37:26.911
You do miss her.

37:28.412 --> 37:29.997
[sentimental music plays]

37:33.960 --> 37:35.086
[breath shudders]

37:35.920 --> 37:37.797
[crying softly]

37:41.050 --> 37:43.552
[softly] Oh, whoa. Oh, whoa.

37:44.387 --> 37:47.056
My daughter. [cries softly]

37:51.519 --> 37:54.522
My… My goodness. [crying]

38:05.992 --> 38:07.994
[sentimental music continues]

38:18.671 --> 38:21.382
My mother had a far better mom
than she deserved.

38:24.885 --> 38:26.012
How frustrating.

38:39.859 --> 38:41.610
[banging loudly]

38:41.694 --> 38:45.448
Psychopathic bitch! Hey, you!
You need to make your wish right now!

38:47.366 --> 38:48.743
CLOSED TODAY

38:48.826 --> 38:51.579
You better do it.
Don't think I'll make mine first!

38:52.747 --> 38:55.124
I don't wanna waste that chance. Fuck!

38:56.417 --> 38:57.710
-Hey!
-[engine rumbling]

38:59.754 --> 39:00.921
[Bo-gyeong whimpers]

39:01.005 --> 39:02.214
[engine accelerating]

39:02.298 --> 39:05.509
[distantly] Come on! Do it now, bitch!

39:09.221 --> 39:13.476
Your marriage is over, Mom?
You got fired and now you're leaving Dad?

39:14.310 --> 39:17.271
You leave too.
You've wanted to be on your own.

39:17.980 --> 39:20.358
For real? Are you buying me an apartment?

39:20.441 --> 39:23.444
You make your plans, it's your life.
From now on, you're on your own.

39:24.153 --> 39:26.781
-I wish you'd never been born.
-What mother says that?

39:27.365 --> 39:28.866
You wish I wasn't even alive?

39:29.658 --> 39:31.952
You can hate me and I can't?
That's how it is?

39:33.287 --> 39:35.748
-I resent having you!
-[gasps]

39:35.831 --> 39:40.419
I gave you two chances.
Everything still went to shit!

39:41.212 --> 39:43.255
[breath trembling]

39:46.592 --> 39:48.594
[suspenseful music playing]

39:52.681 --> 39:53.891
This is your final wish.

39:57.019 --> 39:58.104
[Im-seon] Yes, it is.

39:59.438 --> 40:00.856
As my final wish, I want…

40:07.488 --> 40:09.323
I want you to forget I already…

40:10.574 --> 40:11.951
used the two other wishes.

40:12.993 --> 40:14.412
[sighs, tuts]

40:17.164 --> 40:18.499
The greed of humans.

40:20.000 --> 40:22.002
[whooshing and chiming]

40:32.096 --> 40:33.264
The wish was granted.

40:33.848 --> 40:34.974
[chuckles in relief]

40:35.641 --> 40:38.144
It was? [laughs in relief]

40:40.646 --> 40:42.857
Mortals always fall into this trap.

40:44.108 --> 40:48.279
Think about it. If that wish he made
after 72 years worked…

40:50.156 --> 40:52.032
could I tell you his wish?

40:54.285 --> 40:55.202
What?

40:56.745 --> 40:58.330
-[music intensifies]
-[gasps]

40:59.540 --> 41:00.958
[breath shuddering]

41:06.755 --> 41:08.674
[chiming]

41:08.757 --> 41:09.842
[rumbling]

41:09.925 --> 41:10.801
[Im-seon gasps]

41:15.806 --> 41:18.392
KANG IM-SEON, AUGUST 2, 2024
MADE HER FINAL…

41:21.562 --> 41:22.563
You're going…

41:23.439 --> 41:24.273
to win this one.

41:25.774 --> 41:27.943
We don't know yet.
That was her. There's others.

41:28.569 --> 41:30.154
The YouTuber. The dog too.

41:30.738 --> 41:33.657
Eom Sang-tae and Gu Bo-gyeong
are going to fail? You're certain?

41:35.284 --> 41:39.455
Listen, you have one more wish left.
With that, you can reverse it all.

41:39.997 --> 41:42.208
-Say, "That's my final wish."
-I can't do that.

41:42.291 --> 41:44.502
I won't be able
to catch Eom Sang-tae, and also…

41:47.671 --> 41:48.547
you would lose.

41:53.260 --> 41:54.094
[clears throat]

41:55.304 --> 41:59.016
I'm just curious. After they've used
their three wishes, do they give up?

41:59.099 --> 42:00.726
Don't they ask, "Just one more"?

42:09.443 --> 42:11.612
Once their last wish is finally granted…

42:14.114 --> 42:15.908
do they forget their memories of you?

42:16.617 --> 42:18.536
Do they forget who they've met?

42:18.619 --> 42:20.371
Or what has been lost or gained?

42:21.121 --> 42:23.666
Do they forget all about you
and what they've gone through?

42:24.959 --> 42:25.793
Is that it?

42:32.299 --> 42:33.175
So…

42:36.637 --> 42:37.555
will I too?

42:38.138 --> 42:40.140
[sentimental music plays]

42:49.733 --> 42:50.776
And you'll still…

42:52.403 --> 42:53.654
remember me?

42:56.824 --> 42:57.658
Mm.

43:14.717 --> 43:15.718
It's not fair.

43:41.327 --> 43:43.746
[sentimental music continues]

44:26.372 --> 44:27.206
[music ends]

44:27.289 --> 44:29.708
-[birds chirping]
-[ducks quacking]

44:45.599 --> 44:47.976
I went to Dubai. Jewelry.

44:51.021 --> 44:52.481
Of all things?

44:53.232 --> 44:54.525
Why don't you speak? Huh?

44:55.692 --> 44:57.027
What's happened to your neck?

44:57.111 --> 44:58.946
So that bastard took your voice?

44:59.530 --> 45:02.408
That asshole, Ejllael!
I'm not gonna stand for this! Ahhh!

45:02.491 --> 45:05.285
Hey! Are you insane? Get back here!

45:06.120 --> 45:08.831
[screams silently]

45:08.914 --> 45:11.500
-[growling]
-[Ejllael groans] Stop that!

45:11.583 --> 45:13.460
Let go! Enough already!

45:13.544 --> 45:17.506
-[muffled] Evil!
-[yells] Stop, you animal! Get off me now!

45:19.049 --> 45:21.427
-That's enough! Let go! Stop!
-[Sade growling]

45:21.510 --> 45:23.095
[Iblis] What the hell are you doing?

45:23.178 --> 45:24.930
Take your hands off my jaguar!

45:25.013 --> 45:27.683
-[Sade growling]
-Your beast took a bite out of me!

45:27.766 --> 45:28.600
[crying]

45:28.684 --> 45:30.602
Take him away
or I'll get rid of him forever!

45:31.186 --> 45:34.273
Okay. I'll take him away right now.

45:34.356 --> 45:35.649
[Sade sobbing]

45:38.068 --> 45:39.069
[screams] What the--

45:39.153 --> 45:45.117
-[yelling] How far are you throwing me?
-[upbeat music plays]

45:48.954 --> 45:50.122
[exhales]

45:52.916 --> 45:54.835
[slowed grunting]

45:58.714 --> 45:59.715
[groans]

46:02.259 --> 46:03.218
[bones crunch]

46:03.302 --> 46:04.511
[fluid bubbles]

46:05.554 --> 46:07.681
[slowed groan]

46:09.308 --> 46:12.978
[slowed grunts and groans]

46:16.773 --> 46:18.484
[distant thudding]

46:19.860 --> 46:21.111
[gasps in awe]

46:22.446 --> 46:23.697
[yells]

46:25.032 --> 46:26.283
[groaning]

46:28.577 --> 46:30.787
[screaming]

46:33.415 --> 46:34.833
[fluid bubbles]

46:34.917 --> 46:37.085
[upbeat music continues]

46:46.011 --> 46:47.012
-[music stops]
-[groans]

46:47.095 --> 46:48.472
[both panting]

46:48.555 --> 46:50.849
Let's have a rest. I'm exhausted as hell.

46:51.558 --> 46:52.601
Good, then.

46:54.019 --> 46:54.978
Just tell me one thing.

46:55.604 --> 46:57.064
You said I took your feather.

46:58.649 --> 47:00.275
This was before I was detained?

47:01.902 --> 47:04.947
What did I do with that feather?

47:05.614 --> 47:07.616
How would I know? I have no idea.

47:08.242 --> 47:11.912
Then when was it?
When exactly before I was detained?

47:12.621 --> 47:13.455
[groans]

47:13.539 --> 47:15.249
There's 20 years of memories gone.

47:19.836 --> 47:21.547
Who said that? Did Jinniya?

47:23.549 --> 47:26.093
Wait, I know you.
You're that little shit, aren't you?

47:27.803 --> 47:29.263
There's something you all know.

47:30.847 --> 47:33.809
That's fine. For now,
just go after the life of that immortal.

47:34.601 --> 47:37.020
He's going to come for Ka-young
because she broke the string.

47:37.104 --> 47:38.272
[laughs]

47:39.398 --> 47:42.526
How could I do that?
You seem to have forgotten three things.

47:43.527 --> 47:46.488
Number one. I'm not able
to take a life of an immortal.

47:46.572 --> 47:47.823
I can't even revoke your magic.

47:48.782 --> 47:52.452
Number two. The immortal
isn't after Ka-young, he wants you.

47:52.536 --> 47:54.788
He plans to rule and become your master.

47:56.790 --> 47:57.958
And number three.

47:58.709 --> 48:01.545
I said this already. Shadi's not a slave.

48:03.797 --> 48:04.923
That immortal…

48:06.550 --> 48:08.927
[sighs] he's Shadi's son.

48:09.011 --> 48:09.845
[gasps]

48:11.096 --> 48:12.014
His son?

48:13.390 --> 48:14.391
[sighs] Yes.

48:15.892 --> 48:17.311
[breathing heavily]

48:17.394 --> 48:19.062
I heard Shadi's son had died.

48:25.694 --> 48:27.863
[soft suspenseful music plays]

48:41.251 --> 48:42.169
[pants]

48:42.836 --> 48:45.130
[breathing heavily]

49:03.607 --> 49:04.775
[Jun-u] You're not scared?

49:06.735 --> 49:08.362
[panting]

49:08.445 --> 49:10.739
-You come hiking here often?
-No.

49:11.615 --> 49:12.741
It's my first try.

49:13.492 --> 49:15.869
Hell of a course.
I almost fell. [chuckles]

49:16.453 --> 49:17.704
Anyway, it's good to see you.

49:22.584 --> 49:24.753
[unsettling music plays]

49:25.545 --> 49:26.380
Ka-young.

49:27.839 --> 49:28.965
How many wishes do you have?

49:31.968 --> 49:32.886
[scoffs softly]

49:33.887 --> 49:35.806
I thought it seemed quiet here today.

49:37.140 --> 49:39.518
Please go.
You're not the one who's asking.

49:39.601 --> 49:40.519
So you know.

49:42.354 --> 49:43.772
But I don't know anything.

49:44.356 --> 49:45.982
So just be honest with me, okay?

49:46.858 --> 49:48.360
They want me to ask you.

49:49.403 --> 49:50.696
I don't know what else to do.

49:51.446 --> 49:52.572
They'll murder anyone.

49:53.657 --> 49:56.159
When I answer that question,
I'll be killed anyway.

49:56.952 --> 49:59.204
And all my loved ones
will be in danger again.

50:00.539 --> 50:01.415
That's how it works?

50:02.749 --> 50:04.710
[tuts, sighs]

50:05.502 --> 50:07.421
It's-- Well, I'm in some debt.

50:08.588 --> 50:10.590
I need to do what I was sent to do.

50:13.343 --> 50:15.512
They told me to do it
if you didn't answer.

50:16.888 --> 50:18.056
I hope you know that

50:19.224 --> 50:20.767
it's not personal whatsoever.

50:21.601 --> 50:22.978
[gasps]

50:23.061 --> 50:25.272
[intense music plays]

50:25.939 --> 50:26.773
[gasps]

50:28.692 --> 50:29.526
[whimpers]

50:31.278 --> 50:34.072
[Ka-young] The garage. My repair shop.

50:34.698 --> 50:36.491
My wrench. Frogs.

50:39.953 --> 50:42.497
The sound of drilling. Gamja-tang.

50:42.581 --> 50:44.416
-[laughing]
-Min-ji.

50:44.499 --> 50:45.959
[watch ticking]

50:46.042 --> 50:47.252
-Grandma.
-[chuckles]

50:49.045 --> 50:52.591
[Pan-geum] I will also give you sadness.

50:53.300 --> 50:54.593
-[gasps]
-Lee Mi-ju.

50:54.676 --> 50:56.052
[gasping]

50:59.389 --> 51:00.807
"Ki Ka-young."

51:00.891 --> 51:02.100
Just a buck. Ki Ka-young.

51:02.184 --> 51:04.186
Ki Ka-young. Ki Ka-young!

51:04.269 --> 51:07.105
[Ka-young] You asked to be treated
with care. This is showing you care.

51:07.189 --> 51:08.523
I can't do this if I lose.

51:09.566 --> 51:10.567
[sobs]

51:13.862 --> 51:15.864
[whooshing]

51:23.705 --> 51:24.706
[gasps]

51:27.626 --> 51:30.170
What do you think you're doing?
You really want to die?

51:32.088 --> 51:33.799
So this is what fear is like.

51:34.800 --> 51:35.967
[gasps]

51:36.510 --> 51:37.636
Fear is really scary.

51:40.096 --> 51:41.640
I didn't fall on purpose.

51:42.474 --> 51:45.268
Why didn't you wish?
You should've wished to be saved!

51:46.937 --> 51:47.854
You could've died.

51:48.438 --> 51:49.856
If I make my final wish…

51:55.487 --> 51:56.571
I'll lose you.

52:02.953 --> 52:04.538
[Iblis breathing raggedly]

52:09.376 --> 52:10.627
You damn psychopath!

52:17.175 --> 52:18.260
[Iblis whimpers]

52:18.343 --> 52:20.762
[pop ballad music plays]
